{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1000_033sih", "source_sha256": "62b6acce3ba389b09a2e87c1c7cf0d045cd45a7d67821a1a5dccff3a6f9634a9", "ja": "今回の衣装、シックな雰囲気で素敵ですね。\n大人っぽくて、セクシーでもありますけど……。", "zh": "这次的服装很有沉稳优雅的氛围，真不错呢。\n虽然看起来很成熟，也很性感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d6bb3a4005d11649c16441c683bda5e1ab3eff337ab53cc13444122b60b33100", "ja": "悪の女幹部だからな。威圧感やカリスマ性が\nいろいろ盛り込まれてるんだと思う。", "zh": "毕竟是邪恶女干部嘛。我想应该融入了各种威压感和魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "813ddc43b8beb0aa1031f5825d465ba500818db525dd371d33629971971695b6", "ja": "大事なのは、悪の幹部らしさをどう出すかですよね。\n着こなしも大事になりそうです。", "zh": "重要的是，要如何展现出邪恶干部的感觉呢。\n穿法风格似乎也很关键。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "2544ac22f10ff2d055d88fa1179c0fe66259ba4066cceca69ca6cdff37d833e9", "ja": "正義の前に立ちはだかる強敵として、\n説得力のある雰囲気を出さないと……。", "zh": "作为阻挡在正义面前的强敌，必须营造出令人信服的气势才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "404e1df826bd11fa76c13434a40438b027c53281b90d9092fad10135d68c2eab", "ja": "試しに今、軽く演じてみていいですか？\n現段階での課題を知っておきたいので。", "zh": "我现在可以先试着简单演一下吗？\n我想先了解一下现阶段的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0a3eb814739f97a30013a11955bbbb8f229bc5b91783c3989f8096f884bfac73", "ja": "もちろん。ぜひ見せてくれ。", "zh": "当然可以。请务必让我看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "42f40fe7d330fe0552a9bdb37f24e6f5b546b720f570a95275605b4c0c7702c2", "ja": "ありがとうございます。それじゃ……\n「どうした、トゥインクルリズム」", "zh": "谢谢您。那么……\n“怎么了，Twinkle Rhythm”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "8a52ca8db14a5364a883ec79749dc0d6d7bea33831a6d16f84edbe00352e6b42", "ja": "「ふたりがかりでも私に傷ひとつつけられないとは。\nこの程度なら、ひとりでも十分だったな」", "zh": "「两个人联手，竟然连伤都伤不到我一下。\n只有这种程度的话，一个人来就绰绰有余了」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fda4e7c1906b721e04a79fa254ca1ab746e3faa0b805fd51cd1553088e462aaa", "ja": "おお……！　いいじゃないか！", "zh": "哦……！很不错嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "16841d486ad55368b6907ab4771678218b7d0708c6882bb2cd5753177f978306", "ja": "え……、そうですか？", "zh": "诶……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1010_p", "source_sha256": "52e9d4bdccaeefbbf6312f024973bd63784f27e8209a2f1e9302064a0d3257d4", "ja": "衣装に負けない風格が出てたと思う。\n練習してきたのか？", "zh": "我觉得你展现出了不输给衣装的气质。\n是有练习过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "dab2122da35e6edba598ae739b67556f3d992e15b17bd6474af1a868e2293ea1", "ja": "一応、台本は何度も読みました。\nでも練習はそんなに……。", "zh": "姑且把剧本读了很多遍。\n不过练习倒没怎么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "375ecd15a874ec9173e084482bb14db4b00f8c986f1d843eb6de1ecf0b2bd946", "ja": "あ、そっか。弟のヒーローごっこに付き合って、\nよく悪役を演じたりしてるんです。", "zh": "啊，这样啊。我经常陪弟弟玩英雄游戏，不知不觉就会演起反派。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "f4d48725dd122f4b8290e9df0a4aa5bf906548b79ab31469945d51760997969c", "ja": "喜んでくれるから、私もつい熱が入って……\nそのおかげかもしれません。", "zh": "因为他会很开心，不知不觉我也就投入进去了……\n可能也是托了这方面的福吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2ab5d0a222e6552997b0efea389236e4308c4b92790c1602c88e4cebb0a5a853", "ja": "なるほど、それでサマになってたんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，难怪看起来那么像回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "ec846afe24bde4fa3f5a9c73d22185cb5c90d8570534b35bf783d13e8a1e6578", "ja": "一緒に番組を見ることも、よくあります。\nそういえば、最近は勉強するつもりで見ていたから……", "zh": "我们也经常一起看节目。\n说起来，最近我都是抱着学习的心态在看的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1016_p", "source_sha256": "aa0148bcf8c2b6475d8b1e1f2e9c9104e2d4550dc6164d7fbe542d1c33842850", "ja": "雰囲気もすごく出てたし、役作りで詰めていければ、\nすごく魅力的な悪役になるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "氛围也营造得很足，如果再通过角色塑造进一步打磨，应该能成为非常有魅力的反派吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "0ae71837d0cc11a30617c5266be5ef570be895be4d447b279572305d2ae5946b", "ja": "そうですか……よかったです。\n実は私も今、少し手応えがありました。", "zh": "是吗……那太好了。其实刚才我也稍微有了点把握。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0584_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "7d1968e8a4d1bd0006ef89ac631612fb6aa2c85f3ac0647e30b620da2bd18e36", "ja": "帰ったら、お礼を言わないといけませんね。おかげで\nお姉ちゃん、立派な悪役になれそうって……ふふっ。", "zh": "回去之后，得好好跟他说声谢谢呢。多亏了他，\n姐姐好像能演好一个出色的大反派了……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
